        "description": "The main royal palace with a changing of the guard, and a hillside of traditional houses.",
        "details": "Gyeongbokgung was the grandest Joseon palace, and the guard ceremony happens at the main gate. Renting a hanbok gives free entry to many palaces. Bukchon Hanok Village has traditional houses on lanes, but it is a residential area, so keep voices low.",
