        "description": "A historic food market, a shopping and street-food district, and a barbecue dinner.",
        "details": "Gwangjang Market is known for bindaetteok (mung bean pancakes), mayak kimbap and raw beef. Myeongdong has cosmetics shops and street food after dark. Korean BBQ at a table grill is a must. Most restaurants serve two or more people.",
