        "name": "Namsan Tower, Hongdae and Dongdaemun",
        "description": "A hilltop tower, a youth-culture district and a night shopping market.",
        "details": "N Seoul Tower sits atop Namsan with views over the city and a hiking path. Hongdae has street performers, bars and clubs. Dongdaemun Design Plaza is a Zaha Hadid building and a night market. A cable car reaches Namsan from Myeongdong.",
        "interests": [
          "photography",
