        "name": "Busan Gamcheon Culture Village and Jagalchi Market",
        "description": "A hillside village of coloured houses and a huge fish market.",
        "details": "Gamcheon is a colourful hillside district with murals and cafes, climbing steep lanes. Jagalchi is Korea largest fish market, where you can eat raw fish upstairs. Haeundae and Gwangalli beaches are good for evenings.",
        "interests": [
          "culture",
