        "name": "Haedong Yonggungsa Temple",
        "description": "A rare seaside Buddhist temple on cliffs on the east coast of Busan.",
        "details": "Haedong Yonggungsa sits on rocks above the sea, with stone lanterns and a dragon pavilion. Sunrise is a special time. It is about an hour from central Busan by bus. Allow half a day with a coastal walk.",
        "interests": [
          "culture",
