        "name": "Jeonju Hanok Village and bibimbap",
        "description": "A village of 700 traditional houses, and the home of the dish bibimbap.",
        "details": "Jeonju is known as the gastronomic capital of Korea. The hanok village has traditional houses, tea rooms and street snacks, and visitors can sleep in a hanok. Try bibimbap in its home town and makgeolli rice wine.",
