        "details": "Hallasan National Park has trails to a crater lake, with the Seongpanak route taking about 9 hours return, and reservations required. Seongsan Ilchulbong is a tuff cone rising from the sea at the east end of Jeju. The haenyeo women divers perform on the coast.",
